, 79.38, 80.24], ["Ends", 80.24, 80.96], ["November", 80.96, 81.14], ["29th.", 81.14, 81.92]], "segments": [[0.0, 2.46, "Three signs of dust mites you've been blaming on stress."], [3.06, 4.58, "This is a sign of dust mites."], [4.78, 6.44, "This is a sign of dust mites."], [6.66, 8.46, "This is a sign of dust mites."], [8.64, 10.86, "Waking up tired, puffy, and foggy,"], [11.06, 13.56, "all seem like normal, I'm just getting older things."], [13.9, 16.16, "But they can be signs your bed is working against you."], [16.46, 18.54, "Your mattress can hold hundreds of thousands"], [18.54, 21.1, "of microscopic terrorists called dust mites."], [21.28, 22.52, "And it's not just the mites,"], [22.72, 23.7, "it's what they leave behind."], [24.0, 26.56, "About 20 droppings each, every single day."], [26.76, 27.54, "And they keep breeding."], [27.92, 29.18, "You breathe that in all night"], [29.18, 31.68, "so your nose blocks up, your mouth falls open,"], [31.96, 33.1, "and you never really rest."], [33.28, 34.6, "That's why it shows up in your face,"], [34.96, 36.36, "your focus, your energy."], [36.66, 39.04, "For 20 years, I thought I was just always sick."], [39.28, 41.48, "Doctors said stress, it wasn't just me."], [41.7, 43.7, "And if it was dirt on my pillow, I'd change it."], [43.9, 45.32, "So why was I sleeping in this?"], [45.7, 47.52, "That's why I keep one of these under my mattress"], [47.52, 48.76, "and one under my pillow."], [48.98, 50.18, "I don't even notice they're there."], [50.42, 52.0, "No smell, nothing to plug in."], [52.18, 54.6, "And while I sleep, a plant-derived pheromone lure"], [54.6, 56.16, "pulls dust mites out of hiding"], [56.16, 58.22, "and the adhesive traps them on the card."], [58.22, 60.58, "So they're not in the bed, inches from my face."], [60.92, 63.4, "And my mornings went from foggy to finally awake."], [63.68, 65.24, "When it's time, I pull the card out."], [65.46, 67.62, "It's covered, straight in the bin, clean one in."], [67.92, 69.4, "Fog can show up in a lot of ways,"], [69.68, 71.3, "but it's never just you being lazy."], [71.64, 72.56, "So it's worth dealing with."], [72.86, 75.28, "If you're waking up drained, don't wait another 20 years."], [75.56, 77.16, "Try them yourself, Black Friday."], [77.42, 80.24, "Up to 12 free cards save up to 79%."], [80.24, 81.92, "Ends November 29th."]]}